{% tool-context
   title="Database Selector"
   question="What is database selection?"
   definition="Database selection chooses the ownership and transaction boundary that will protect correctness while serving the system's hardest access paths."
   inputs="Model the primary data shape, transaction scope, hardest query, consistency contract, traffic, latency, failure domains, and operating team before naming products."
   outcome="Use the ranked categories to expose contradictions, companion-store boundaries, and the conditions that should trigger a future migration."
